^{:go/end 561} (go/func rewritetoinsn "Rewrite the instruction at offset into newinsn. Also, verify the\nexisting instruction under mask matches the check value.\n" [^{:tag (* ld/Target)} target ^{:tag (* loader/Loader)} ldr ^{:tag (* loader/SymbolBuilder)} su ^int64 offset ^uint32 mask ^uint32 check ^uint32 newinsn]
